cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "LLM-based Heritage Monitoring Report"
abstract: >-
  Prompt design and statistical code that transform instrumental monitoring
  data from built heritage assets into a weekly monitoring report written by a
  Large Language Model (LLM). The module calculates descriptive statistics for
  each sensor (historical mean and standard deviation, weekly mean/min/max, and
  3σ deviations) and provides them to the LLM as a structured JSON data block,
  with strict rules for data fidelity, scope limits and statistical
  interpretation.
